{
  "page": 27,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Justification: The paper provides open access to the data and code, with dedicated README",
      "bbox": [
        143.67599487304688,
        75.2083740234375,
        504.0021667480469,
        84.11493682861328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "files and instructions to reproduce the main experimental results comes with the supplemental",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        86.11737060546875,
        503.9969177246094,
        95.02393341064453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "material.",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        97.0263671875,
        179.00411987304688,
        105.93292999267578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        112.01934814453125,
        189.80355834960938,
        120.92591094970703
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that paper does not include experiments requiring code.",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        127.0113525390625,
        477.8421630859375,
        135.91790771484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Please see the NeurIPS code and data submission guidelines (https://nips.cc/",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        139.96234130859375,
        505.0660400390625,
        148.92868041992188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "public/guides/CodeSubmissionPolicy) for more details.",
      "bbox": [
        163.791015625,
        150.871337890625,
        412.9630126953125,
        159.83767700195312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• While we encourage the release of code and data, we understand that this might not be",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        163.82232666015625,
        504.00006103515625,
        172.72894287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "possible, so “No” is an acceptable answer. Papers cannot be rejected simply for not",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        174.73138427734375,
        503.99993896484375,
        183.637939453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "including code, unless this is central to the contribution (e.g., for a new open-source",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        185.641357421875,
        503.9998779296875,
        194.54791259765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "benchmark).",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        196.55035400390625,
        213.86302185058594,
        205.4569091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The instructions should contain the exact command and environment needed to run to",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        209.5013427734375,
        503.99554443359375,
        218.40789794921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reproduce the results. See the NeurIPS code and data submission guidelines (https:",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        220.41033935546875,
        506.62225341796875,
        229.37667846679688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "//nips.cc/public/guides/CodeSubmissionPolicy) for more details.",
      "bbox": [
        163.26800537109375,
        231.3193359375,
        464.73101806640625,
        240.28567504882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should provide instructions on data access and preparation, including how",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        244.27032470703125,
        504.356689453125,
        253.17694091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to access the raw data, preprocessed data, intermediate data, and generated data, etc.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        255.17938232421875,
        499.2119140625,
        264.0859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should provide scripts to reproduce all experimental results for the new",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        268.13037109375,
        504.3616027832031,
        277.03692626953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "proposed method and baselines. If only a subset of experiments are reproducible, they",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        279.03936767578125,
        504.35260009765625,
        287.9459228515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "should state which ones are omitted from the script and why.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        289.9483642578125,
        405.7626037597656,
        298.85491943359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• At submission time, to preserve anonymity, the authors should release anonymized",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        302.89935302734375,
        503.99652099609375,
        311.805908203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "versions (if applicable).",
      "bbox": [
        163.54200744628906,
        313.808349609375,
        257.7384338378906,
        322.71490478515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Providing as much information as possible in supplemental material (appended to the",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        326.75933837890625,
        503.99481201171875,
        335.6659240722656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "paper) is recommended, but including URLs to data and code is permitted.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        337.6683654785156,
        461.04510498046875,
        346.5749206542969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "6. Experimental Setting/Details",
      "bbox": [
        131.41200256347656,
        352.54180908203125,
        266.4548034667969,
        361.56793212890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Does the paper specify all the training and test details (e.g., data splits, hyper-",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        367.6533508300781,
        505.6484680175781,
        376.5599060058594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "parameters, how they were chosen, type of optimizer, etc.) necessary to understand the",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        378.5633544921875,
        504.00225830078125,
        387.46990966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "results?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        389.47235107421875,
        174.30177307128906,
        398.37890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [Yes]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        404.46435546875,
        201.47940063476562,
        413.37091064453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: Appendix A.5 provides all the necessary information to understand the experi-",
      "bbox": [
        143.67599487304688,
        419.4573669433594,
        505.65838623046875,
        428.3639221191406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "mental results.",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        430.3663635253906,
        201.97787475585938,
        439.2729187011719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        445.359375,
        189.80355834960938,
        454.26593017578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not include experiments.",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        460.3523864746094,
        432.1935729980469,
        469.2589416503906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The experimental setting should be presented in the core of the paper to a level of detail",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        473.3033752441406,
        503.9983825683594,
        482.2099304199219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that is necessary to appreciate the results and make sense of them.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        484.2123718261719,
        426.53472900390625,
        493.1189270019531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The full details can be provided either with the code, in appendix, or as supplemental",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        497.1633605957031,
        504.0042419433594,
        506.0699157714844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "material.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        508.0723876953125,
        198.9291229248047,
        516.9789428710938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "7. Experiment Statistical Significance",
      "bbox": [
        131.41200256347656,
        522.94580078125,
        292.19818115234375,
        531.971923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Does the paper report error bars suitably and correctly defined or other appropriate",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        538.057373046875,
        503.9971008300781,
        546.9639282226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "information about the statistical significance of the experiments?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        548.9673461914062,
        401.3294982910156,
        557.8739013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [Yes]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        563.9593505859375,
        201.47940063476562,
        572.8659057617188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: Main quantitative results in Table 2 report the mean and standard deviation",
      "bbox": [
        143.67599487304688,
        578.952392578125,
        503.99517822265625,
        587.8589477539062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "over 8 runs given different random seeds.",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        589.861328125,
        308.64739990234375,
        598.7678833007812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        604.8543701171875,
        189.80355834960938,
        613.7609252929688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not include experiments.",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        619.8473510742188,
        432.1935729980469,
        628.75390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should answer \"Yes\" if the results are accompanied by error bars, confi-",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        632.79833984375,
        505.65228271484375,
        641.7048950195312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dence intervals, or statistical significance tests, at least for the experiments that support",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        643.7073974609375,
        504.0046081542969,
        652.6139526367188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the main claims of the paper.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        654.6163330078125,
        278.8988952636719,
        663.5228881835938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The factors of variability that the error bars are capturing should be clearly stated (for",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        667.5673828125,
        504.1644287109375,
        676.4739379882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "example, train/test split, initialization, random drawing of some parameter, or overall",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        678.4763793945312,
        504.00067138671875,
        687.3829345703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "run with given experimental conditions).",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        689.3853759765625,
        325.6731872558594,
        698.2919311523438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The method for calculating the error bars should be explained (closed form formula,",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        702.3363647460938,
        505.2456970214844,
        711.242919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "call to a library function, bootstrap, etc.)",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        713.245361328125,
        324.54754638671875,
        722.1519165039062
      ],
      "direction": [
